  "mach:judgement": "Adopt",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The authoritative repository for biomedical ontologies — 1,000+ terminologies including OBO Foundry standards, SNOMED CT, LOINC, RxNorm, and ICD. NIH-funded, Stanford-maintained, production REST API. Used as the ontology resolution layer by major clinical AI platforms including Elicit and Climb. Free API key required (registration, no charge). Adopt for any team doing clinical NLP, concept normalisation, entity linking, or knowledge graph construction — BioPortal provides the fastest path to cross-ontology concept lookup and semantic text annotation without building terminology infrastructure from scratch.",
  "mach:editorialReviewedAt": "2026-06-12",
